# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env — Environment Variables
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual API keys there.
#   2. Never commit .env (it's in .gitignore) — and just as important,
#      never zip, screenshot, or paste it anywhere either, including into
#      an AI chat. A previous version of this project got a real
#      Supabase service_role key exposed exactly that way. If a secret is
#      ever exposed like that, rotate it — don't just remove the file.
#   3. Add these same values as GitHub Actions Secrets (Settings → Secrets)
#      for the scheduled pipeline, and as Vercel env vars for the Admin
#      Panel (only the VITE_ prefixed ones — see admin-panel/.env.example).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── AI Script Generation ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/ → Get API key
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Optional. Gemini model names retire on a ~4-6 month cycle (this project
# has already hit that once — the original hardcoded gemini-1.5-flash is
# very likely dead by the time you read this). Leave unset to use the
# code's current default, or override here without touching code. Check
# https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models for what's current.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash

# ── Visual B-Roll Assets (stock_footage render style only) ────────
# Get from: https://www.pexels.com/api/ → Your API Key
PEXELS_API_KEY=your_pexels_api_key_here

# ── Database & Storage ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here

# ── YouTube Publishing ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Run `python engine/publisher.py --setup` once locally (needs a real
# browser) — it opens Google's consent screen, then prints these three
# values for you to paste in here and as GitHub secrets. See
# docs/04_AUTONOMOUS_YOUTUBE_PUBLISHING.md, including the note about
# refresh tokens expiring after 7 days if your OAuth consent screen is
# still in "Testing" status.
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=your_youtube_client_id_here
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_youtube_client_secret_here
YOUTUBE_REFRESH_TOKEN=your_youtube_refresh_token_here

# ── Pipeline Settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────
OUTPUT_DIR=output
ASSETS_DIR=assets
# PUBLISH_PER_RUN=1   # optional override — normally set via the Admin Panel's Settings page instead
